monologue - "Press [Tab]" for messages

* - proficiency - weapon, flurry, lunge, dodge, constitution

-- specs
Vampirism
Nova
Drain
Weaken

-- classes
Blacksmith - forge armor/weapon
Sorcerer - ritual scribing (long casting but free)
Monk - fist & all weapon skill - weight 0, speed 5, damage 3
Scout - run/jump cost 0
Witch - charm & control target
Summoner - summon perma 1
Necromancer - raise dead
Hexer - cause buff
Rogue - hiding
Warrior - blocking free

-- powers (per encounter)
any block removal - 2
mistform - 1
time travel - loads last save, randomly save every 30 ~ 60 sec. 1
teleport - teleport to coordinates (unknown). 1
telekinesis - move target prop/unit. 1
touch of gold - depends on yellow in sprite. 1
pocket dimension - store an area and recall. 1

-- artifacts
memory amulet - remembers location it was put on
eel trident - gains charge over time, hits 100% when 100 charge
dying dagger - instant kill if hits, destroyed if not
sadim's glove - anything it hits turns into gold, including itself
lifegem amulet - auto regens to 3 durability every encounter
bloodgem amulet - regens to 3 durability by absorbing corpses
interdimensional coin - spawn random item
ancient potion - perm inc str/agi

-- enemies
field slime - field, slow, AC 0
slime - sewer, poison, slow, AC 4
dog - field, fast, weak, grouped (leap from behind), constitution (no fall), AC 2
warrior, spearman, archer
wizard - cast combust (target burns)
summoner - cast summon undead (run - summon, repeats)